sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Runtime as Runtime Framework<br/>Plugin (Flux/MPI/CoSched/Volcano)
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant NetPol as NetworkPolicy Reconciler
    participant Progression as Progression Tracker
    participant Pods as Training Pods

    Note over User,Pods: Training Workload Submission Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob CR<br/>(references TrainingRuntime)
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission request (CREATE)<br/>TLS, Fail policy
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Defaulted TrainJob<br/>(unset fields populated)
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission request (CREATE)<br/>TLS, Fail policy
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated<br/>(schema + semantic checks)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    Note over Controller,Pods: Distributed Execution Orchestration

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get TrainingRuntime/ClusterTrainingRuntime
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Runtime template spec
    Controller->>Runtime: Resolve runtime + select plugin
    Runtime-->>Controller: Pod templates, volumes,<br/>scheduling directives

    alt Flux/MPI Plugin
        Runtime->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap + Secret<br/>per-job config/credentials
    else CoScheduling Plugin
        Runtime->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup CR<br/>scheduling.x-k8s.io
    else Volcano Plugin
        Runtime->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup CR<br/>scheduling.volcano.sh
    end

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet CR<br/>(computed pod templates)
    K8sAPI->>JobSet: Watch event: JobSet created
    JobSet->>K8sAPI: Create training Pods

    Note over NetPol,Pods: RHOAI Operational Flows

    Controller->>NetPol: Reconcile NetworkPolicy
    NetPol->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>(ingress scoped by jobset-name label)

    K8sAPI->>Pods: Schedule + run training pods
    Pods-->>K8sAPI: Pod status updates

    loop Status Tracking
        Progression->>K8sAPI: List pods by namespace/label
        K8sAPI-->>Progression: Pod statuses
        Progression->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status conditions
    end

    JobSet-->>K8sAPI: JobSet status (completed/failed)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Reconcile TrainJob status<br/>from JobSet status
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob status: Complete
